#. (itstool) path: sect1/para
#: C/index.docbook:213
msgid ""
"The <application>Sticky Notes</application> panel application enables you to"
" create, view, and manage sticky notes on your desktop. You can edit the "
"title, contents, dimensions, and style of sticky notes. When the panel is "
"restarted, for example when you log out and log in again, all sticky notes "
"are saved and reopened in the same position with the same dimensions and "
"style."
msgstr ""
"Paneļa lietotne <application>Līmlapiņas</application> ļauj izveidot, skatīt "
"un pārvaldīt līmlapiņas uz darbvirsmas. Līmlapiņām var mainīt virsrakstu, "
"saturu, izmērus un stilu. Kad panelis tiek pārstartēts, piemēram, kad "
"izrakstāties un atkal piesakāties, visas līmlapiņas tiek saglabātas un atkal "
"atvērtas tajā pašā vietā ar tiem pašiem izmēriem un stilu."

#. (itstool) path: sect2/title
#: C/index.docbook:222
msgid "To Add Sticky Notes to a Panel"
msgstr "Kā pievienot Līmlapiņas panelim"

#. (itstool) path: sect2/para
#: C/index.docbook:223
msgid ""
"To add <application>Sticky Notes</application> to a panel, perform the "
"following steps:"
msgstr ""
"Lai pievienotu <application>Līmlapiņas</application> panelim, veiciet šīs "
"darbības:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:229
