#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:234
msgid "Choose <guimenuitem>Add to Panel</guimenuitem>."
msgstr "Izvēlieties <guimenuitem>Pievienot panelim</guimenuitem>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:239
msgid ""
"Scroll down the list of items in the <guilabel>Add to Panel</guilabel> "
"dialog, then select <guilabel>Sticky Notes</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Dialoglodziņā <guilabel>Pievienot panelim</guilabel> ritiniet vienumu "
"sarakstu uz leju un atlasiet <guilabel>Līmlapiņas</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:245
msgid "Click <guibutton>Add</guibutton>."
msgstr "Noklikšķiniet uz <guibutton>Pievienot</guibutton>."

#. (itstool) path: sect2/para
#: C/index.docbook:250
msgid ""
"The layout of the <application>Sticky Notes</application> applet varies "
"depending on the size and type of panel in which the applet resides."
msgstr ""
"Sīklietotnes <application>Līmlapiņas</application> izkārtojums mainās "
"atkarībā no tā, cik liels un kāda veida ir panelis, kurā sīklietotne atrodas."

