#. (itstool) path: sect2/title
#: C/index.docbook:286
msgid "Locking and Unlocking Sticky Notes"
msgstr "Līmlapiņu bloķēšana un atbloķēšana"

#. (itstool) path: sect2/para
#: C/index.docbook:287
msgid ""
"You can lock or unlock all sticky notes at the same time, or you can lock or"
" unlock individual sticky notes. Locking a sticky note prevents you from "
"accidentally changing the contents of the note."
msgstr ""
"Var bloķēt vai atbloķēt visas līmlapiņas uzreiz vai arī atsevišķas "
"līmlapiņas. Līmlapiņas bloķēšana neļauj nejauši mainīt piezīmes saturu."

