"Kad līmlapiņa ir fokusā, ar taustiņu <shortcut><keysym>F6</keysym></"
"shortcut> var pārvietoties starp teksta apgabalu un virsraksta joslu (kurā "
"ir pogas <guimenuitem><guilabel>Bloķēt</guilabel></guimenuitem> un "
"<guimenuitem><guilabel>Dzēst</guilabel></guimenuitem>)."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:380
msgid ""
"Once in the title bar, use <shortcut><keysym>F10</keysym></shortcut>, "
"<shortcut><keycombo><keysym>Shift-F10</keysym></keycombo></shortcut> or the "
"<shortcut><keysym>Menu</keysym></shortcut> key to open the context menu, "
"which allows to access the individual note’s "
"<guimenuitem><guilabel>Properties</guilabel></guimenuitem> dialog."
msgstr ""
"Virsraksta joslā ar <shortcut><keysym>F10</keysym></shortcut>, <shortcut>"
"<keycombo><keysym>Shift-F10</keysym></keycombo></shortcut> vai taustiņu "
"<shortcut><keysym>Menu</keysym></shortcut> atveriet konteksta izvēlni, no "
"kuras var atvērt atsevišķās piezīmes dialoglodziņu <guimenuitem><guilabel>"
